      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human-decision dispatcher only\nChecks **Idea Review** and **Content Review** every five minutes, or manually. No new campaign planning and no automatic next-week generation.\n\nEach decision carries its stable idea/content ID, version and instructions into the main CMO. This execution waits for that decision to complete. The worker deduplicates processed decisions; changed instructions remain a new decision.\n\nKeep separate idea and finished-asset approvals. Reject needs specific instructions. Use Main CMO **start_batch** / **release_batch** explicitly for production and Buffer release.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 890,
        "color": 4
      }
